OL,3,AFlash flood on Nepal-Tibet border kills
OL,4,Aat least 98, with hundreds of foreign
OL,5,Atourists missing
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 95 people have been killed in
OL,8,FNepal, and hundreds of tourists are
OL,9,Fmissing, after a massive flash flood
OL,10,Fand mudslide on the Nepal-Tibet border
OL,12,FThe missing tourists include more than
OL,13,F100 from India, 54 from the US, and 33
OL,14,Ffrom the UK, according to Nepal's
OL,15,Ftourist board. The area is popular with
OL,16,Fpilgrims and trekkers
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
